<title>POLAND: Polish wheat/barley prices rise, rye down last week.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat/barley prices rise, rye down last week.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesale wheat and barley prices rose last week while rye prices eased, the Agriculture Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Polish farm auction prices (average/zloty per quintal)</p>
<p> Product    wk to Sep 21  pvs week   six-wk range  yr/yr change</p>
<p> Wheat	64.18 zl/q    63.17 zl/q  61-67 zl/q     73 pct</p>
<p> Rye	  41.72 zl/q    41.75 zl/q  38-44 zl/q     68 pct</p>
<p> Barley     53.60 zl/q    52.25 zl/q  52-58 zl/q     64 pct</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
